Quiet stories to read together

Two gentle four-page stories about friendship and settling down. Read together; these are not
controlled-vocabulary decodable readers.

Contents
Ted-E-Bear’s Blanket Fort

   Starts on page 2 - 5 printed pages
Meow-inara’s Moonlight Story

   Starts on page 7 - 5 printed pages

Read together where needed. Choose the pages you want to print.
